---
title: Truffle Torte
description: An extremely rich and decadent chocolate dessert
source: Delia Smith's Christmas <urn:isbn:0563360488>
author: Derek Fuller
servings: 10
course: Dessert
prep time: 20m
cook time: 5m
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- vegetarian
- torte
- dessert
- sweet
---

Melt the @plain chocolate{450%g}. Stir in the @liquid glucose{5%tbsp}. Stir in the @rum{5%tbsp}. The mixture may be warmed if too thick.

Stir half of the @double cream{1%pint}(lightly whipped) into the chocolate. Then stir the mixture into the remaining cream.

Oil and line a #9/10 inch tin{}. Sprinkle the bottom of the tin with the @Ratafia or Amaretti biscuits{85%g}(crushed) and add the chocolate mixture. Smooth the top of the mixture by shaking the tin. Put in the fridge to set.

Turn out upside down and sprinkle the top with @cocoa{1%tsp} from a sieve.
 
Serve with @./Sweet/Raspberry Coulis{}.